{"ticker":"PANW","updated":"2026-10-23T23:26:19Z","profile":{"longName":"Palo Alto Networks, Inc.","shortName":"Palo Alto Networks, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.paloaltonetworks.com","fullTimeEmployees":21921,"marketCap":311289905152,"trailingPE":951.37494,"forwardPE":77.99642,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":27.115845,"pegRatio":1.81,"targetMeanPrice":398.52,"targetHighPrice":525.0,"targetLowPrice":190.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":50,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.345,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.70383,"operatingMargins":0.05396,"profitMargins":0.02674,"totalRevenue":11480000512,"beta":0.933,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":432.33,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":139.57,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Palo Alto Networks, Inc. provides cybersecurity solutions in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia Pacific, and Japan. It offers Prisma Access, a secure access service edge solution; Strata Cloud Manager, a network security management solution; and Prisma AIRS to protect customers' entire AI ecosystem. It provides a comprehensive cloud native application protection platform; and Code to Cloud platform, as well as offers VM-Series and CN-Series virtual firewalls for inline network security on multi- and hybrid-cloud environments. It provides security operation solutions through the Cortex platform that includes Cortex XSIAM, an AI-driven security operations platform; Cortex XDR to prevent, detect, and respond to cybersecurity attacks; and Cortex XSOAR for security orchestration, automation, and response; and Cortex Xpanse for attack surface management, as well as offers threat intelligence and advisory services under the Unit 42 name. It provides subscription services covering the areas of threat prevention, malware and persistent threat, URL filtering, laptop and mobile device protection, DNS security, Internet of Things security, SaaS security API, and SaaS security inline; and threat intelligence, data loss prevention, services to resolve network disruptions, and sensitive data protection. It offers professional services, including architecture design and pl","summary_zh":"Palo Alto Networks, Inc. 在美洲、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區和日本提供網路安全解決方案。它提供 Prisma Access，一種安全存取服務邊緣解決方案； Strata Cloud Manager，網路安全管理解決方案；和 Prisma AIRS 來保護客戶的整個人工智慧生態系統。提供全面的雲端原生應用程式保護平台；和程式碼到雲端平台，並提供 VM 系列和 CN 系列虛擬防火牆，以實現多雲和混合雲環境中的內聯網路安全。它透過Cortex平台提供安全營運解決方案，包括AI驅動的安全營運平台Cortex XSIAM； Cortex XDR 用於預防、偵測和回應網路安全攻擊； Cortex XSOAR 用於安全編排、自動化和回應； Cortex Xpanse 用於攻擊面管理，並以 Unit 42 名義提供威脅情報和諮詢服務。它提供的訂閱服務涵蓋威脅防禦、惡意軟體和持續威脅、URL過濾、筆記型電腦和行動裝置保護、DNS安全、物聯網安全、SaaS安全API和SaaS安全內聯等領域；威脅情報、資料遺失防護、解決網路中斷的服務以及敏感資料保護。它提供專業的服務，包括建築設計和平面設計","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":185.18,"h":186.07,"l":181.91,"c":184.55,"v":5801200},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":184.22,"h":186.66,"l":183.99,"c":184.23,"v":8319100},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":185.0,"h":188.21,"l":184.69,"c":187.61,"v":5990600},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":187.44,"h":191.57,"l":187.2,"c":191.02,"v":6031800},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":191.37,"h":192.79,"l":190.03,"c":190.52,"v":5195200},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":187.26,"h":191.59,"l":186.35,"c":190.52,"v":7066900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":188.95,"h":192.35,"l":188.05,"c":191.53,"v":5482600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":191.53,"h":194.48,"l":188.75,"c":192.35,"v":5996100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":193.6,"h":196.34,"l":191.85,"c":194.46,"v":5670400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":195.19,"h":197.9,"l":194.79,"c":197.38,"v":5503800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":197.69,"h":198.13,"l":195.77,"c":197.55,"v":4074000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":197.84,"h":202.72,"l":195.7,"c":197.33,"v":6342400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":198.0,"h":200.8,"l":197.72,"c":198.33,"v":4327500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":197.18,"h":199.95,"l":196.16,"c":196.29,"v":4431600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":198.05,"h":202.11,"l":197.37,"c":201.28,"v":6076900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":201.5,"h":202.12,"l":198.76,"c":201.34,